        "body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We're a UK trading card business, run by collectors. We buy and sell Pokémon cards — singles, sealed product and graded slabs — and we help people move collections on when the time comes. One Piece is on the way.</p>",
