            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          }
        },
        "p1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most people come to us for one of two reasons: they're chasing a card they can't find, or they've got a collection they don't know what to do with. We're built around both.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "narrow",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          }
        },
        "p2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>On the buying side, that means describing cards honestly, pricing them against what the market is actually doing, and being reachable if you want to ask something before you commit.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "narrow",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          }
        },
        "p3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>On the selling side it means explaining how we've reached an offer rather than just handing you a number — and being clear that asking us costs you nothing and commits you to nothing.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "narrow",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "p1",
        "p2",
        "p3"
      ]
